# demolition_a prototype overrides: <addr> <prototype>;  (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 11)
# Prototypes read from the x86 code: thiscall "this" made explicit, float parameters as float.
# Names are ours. Functions that other modules already call with the table's integer types
# (int / unsigned int * for "this") keep those parameter types, so their calls still compile.

# ---------- Demolition/CModule_Demolition.c
